---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Logo from '../assets/rohan_logo.svg';
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';

---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
    <style>
      body {
        margin: 0;
      }

      h1 {
        font-weight: 700;
        text-align: center;
        letter-spacing: .05em;
      }

      .logo {
      display: block;
      margin: 2rem auto 0; 
      width: 300px;
      height: auto;
    }

    main {
      padding: 2rem;
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    </style>
  </head>
  
  <body>
    <Navbar />
    <div class="logo">
      <Logo />
    </div>

    <main>
      <h1>Rohan Bopardikar</h1>
      <p>
        Hi, I'm Rohan. 

        I am originally from Portland, OR and right now, am wrapping up my undergrad at ASU where I studied Math and Computer Science. In the Fall, I will 
        move to NYC to pursue graduate study at Columbia. Go Lions!

        <br>
        <br>

        My broad academic interests are in agentic systems and post-training methods. My research at ASU, mainly under the supervision
        of 
        <a href="https://sites.google.com/view/jiazou-web/home?authuser=0" target="_blank">Dr. Jia Zou</a>
        , studies the application of LLMs/LLM-agents to data wrangling tasks. You can learn more about the research I did at ASU here and here. 

        <br>
        <br>

        Some of my more casual interests include reading, algorithmic trading, and playing TFT. 
      </p>
    </main>

    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>
